":27,"created_at":"2026-09-25T08:25:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T08:25:18Z"},{"id":587900479,"node_id":"RA_kwDODHOywc4jCqY_","name":"multiple.intoto.jsonl","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":17878,"digest":"sha256:8b37a4998b781eaadef88fbda7770f1e77396ebb3346768322e798a4165afb88","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-25T08:26:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T08:26:27Z"}],"body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n* feat: Print skip reasons in live plan output by @vishnukothakapu in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4715\r\n* [LIB+CLI] Add flag to explicitly preserve `null` values in merge by @mozesl-nokia in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4746\r\n* Add a resource file name filter to kpt selectors and improve test/docs for selectors by @liamfallon in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4743\r\n* added inventory check in live destroy/status by @OisinJohnston2005 in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4685\r\n* Error when explicit destination of pkg get already exists by @gangadhar-res in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4696\r\n* moved live logs to stderr by @OisinJohnston2005 in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4691\r\n* Publish deb/rpm/apk Linux packages in the GoReleaser release by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4753\r\n* Tag lister improvements (restructure files, pass TLS certificates) by @mozesl-nokia in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4636\r\n\r\n### Behavioral changes\r\n* Feature: Implement comprehensive field validation for Kptfile (#4735) by @adi-coderr in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4742\r\n* Accept scp-style and local `upstream.git.repo` values in Kptfile validation by @chiliec in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4750\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n* Fix copy-merge to preserve locally-added files in upstream-deleted directories by @kushnaidu in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4720\r\n* Fix Kptfile pipeline not updating on pkg update with fast-forward/force-delete-replace by @OisinJohnston2005 in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4704\r\n* Fix incorrect handling when unfetched packages are deleted from upstream by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4695\r\n* run: add authoritative gitCommit ldflag override for version command (#4752) by @adi-coderr in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4757\r\n\r\n### Dependencies\r\n* Bump github.com/google/cel-go from 0.28.1 to 0.29.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4771\r\n\r\n### Docs & internal\r\n* Docs: Fix installation page URLs, versioning, and SLSA verification instructions by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4717\r\n* Docs: inline function Dockerfile, remove kfn download link by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4734\r\n* Docs: Add external link validation with lychee by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4707\r\n* docs: add KRM function developer guide by @efiacor in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4726\r\n* Improve kpt version resolution in setup-go-kpt composite action by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4730\r\n* Improve make/testing.mk coverage targets by @liamfallon in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4751\r\n* Add a script to generate PR and release reports by @liamfallon in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4729\r\n* Retire self-hosted Homebrew tap now that kpt is in homebrew-core by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4749\r\n* Bump Homebrew formula to v1.0.0 by @aravindtga in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4722\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @vishnukothakapu made their first contribution in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4715\r\n* @kushnaidu made their first contribution in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4720\r\n* @gangadhar-res made their first contribution in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4696\r\n* @adi-coderr made their first contribution in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4742\r\n* @chiliec made their first contribution in https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/pull/4750\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kptdev/kpt/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0","mentions_count":11}
